ass=\"option-row\">--config string</div>\n        <p class=\"option-description\">Path to a kubeadm configuration file.</p>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"option-row\">--dry-run</div>\n        <p class=\"option-description\">Don't apply any changes; just output what would be done.</p>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"option-row\">-h, --help</div>\n        <p class=\"option-description\">help for bootstrap-token</p>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"right-empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n    <aside class=\"rightbar\">\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <div class=\"action\"><span class=\"action-icon\">↗</span><span>Edit this page</span></div>\n        <div class=\"action\"><span class=\"action-icon\">↗</span><span>Create child page</span></div>\n        <div class=\"action\"><span class=\"action-icon\">◉</span><span>Create an issue</span></div>\n        <div class=\"action\"><span class=\"action-icon\">▣</span><span>Print entire section</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"toc\">\n        <div>kubeadm init phase preflight</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase certs</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase kubeconfig</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase etcd</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase control-<br>plane</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase kubelet-<br>start</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase wait-<br>control-plane</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase upload-<br>config</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase upload-<br>certs</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase mark-<br>control-plane</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase<br>bootstrap-token</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase kubelet-<br>finalize</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase<br>bootstrap-token</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase addon</div>\n        <div>kubeadm init phase show-<br>join-command</div>\n        <div>What's next</div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
